### 1. List all study sessions
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions


### 2. View session details
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions/detail?id=1


### 3. View non-existent session
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions/detail?id=999


### 4. Show add session form
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions/add


### 5. Add a new study session
POST http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions/save
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

subjectId=2&minutes=75&notes=Mechanics%20practice


### 6. Verify new session
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/sessions


### 7. List all subjects
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/subjects


### 8. Status check
GET http://localhost:8080/study-planner/status

# Expected:
# HTTP 200 OK
# X-Planner-Version: 1.0
# Study Sessions Planner is running!